tuto.villager-actions:
Your turn. In Summer, a Villager in the Village can do 3 things:
• <bold>activate</bold> an adjacent card (recruit the Companion, buy the Item or use the Building);
• <bold>gain coins</bold>: as many <coin/> as there are <bold>other Villagers</bold> around one of the 2 adjacent cards (here, it would be 0 <coin/>…);
• <bold>participate in the Event</bold>, only once per year (so you cannot do it here).

tuto.final-score:
At the end of the game, add to the <vp/> already gained:
• the <vp/> from Quests;
• the <vp/> from Companions;
• the <vp/> from Items;
• 2 <vp/> if you have at least 3 <force/> and 3 <magic/>, or 5 <vp/> if you have 5 <force/> and 5 <magic/>.
